OL,5,G0230 Dad's Army
OL,6,     F19/26. The platoon must pave the
OL,7,     Fway for a convoy, but then a
OL,8,     Fcircus turns up. Adapted from BBC
OL,9,     FTV with Arthur Lowe. From 1976.
OL,10,G0300 Plum House
OL,11,     F1/6. The team record an audio tour
OL,12,     Fto get visitors flocking, but they
OL,13,     Fcan't agree on who'll star in it.
OL,14,     FStars Tom Bell. From 2018.
OL,15,G0330 Adrian Mole and The Weapons of
OL,16,G     Mass Destruction
OL,17,     F1/10. 4 Extra Debut. Adrian Mole's
OL,18,     Fdiary restarts in 2002 with the
OL,19,     FIraq War looming. He is working in
OL,20,     Fa Leicester bookshop. Read by
OL,21,     FHarry McEntire.
